  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut cauliflower into small florets. In a large bowl, add cauliflower, mild curry paste and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Transfer to a lined oven tray. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the cauliflower between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f8fb6d967cc1a8228410c/step-37626bd8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the cauliflower is roasting, finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, currants, the water and vegetable stock powder and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f8fb6d967cc1a8228410c/step-3a23f5c3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the rice is cooking, roughly chop 1/2 the cucumber and grate the remainder. Halve cherry tomatoes. Roughly chop mint leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f8fb6d967cc1a8228410c/step-7421a525.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine chopped cucumber, cherry tomatoes and 1/2 the mint. Drizzle with olive oil and white wine vinegar. Toss to coat.\n• Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f8fb6d967cc1a8228410c/step-137ed626.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a small bowl, add Greek-style yoghurt, grated cucumber and remaining mint. Add a drizzle of olive oil, season and mix well.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f8fb6d967cc1a8228410c/step-470e4678.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir baby spinach leaves through the garlic rice.\n• Divide the garlic rice between bowls and top with the Indian-style curried cauliflower, cherry tomato salsa and mint raita. Sprinkle with roasted cashews to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/625f8fb6d967cc1a8228410c/step-e419145f.jpg"
    }
  ]
